  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mubuga Coffee Processing Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee.Beneficiaries: 814 (636 women).Description: The project will provide Mubuga Coffee Ltd. with seed capital and technical assistance to help it improve its operations and sales for the benefit of the farmers in its supply chain. The company will improve its business management skills, the facilities at the washing station, and its access to working capital to better supply the rising demand for Rwanda roasted coffee.</narrative>
  </description>
